Z||000000||LAMBO||05-24-2000||02:02 PM||||Called a local salvage yard this morning to see what they had for Fieros; guy said he had 7 and to come on down and walk the yard (this was one of those pull your own parts places). So off I went at lunch. Wow!, had almost everything I needed between all the Fieros, and then some. Like perfect seats, a couple dashes that hadn't cracked yet, perfect front and rear fascias. Going to try and take a half a day tomorrow and go pull some parts.  ||||reg||10
Z||000001||Gold-86SE||05-24-2000||02:08 PM||||<BR>If it is possible, can you pick up a few parts for me.<P>1) The handle for the sunroof, it is the part that is bolted to the glass.<P>2) The 3 spoke GT steering wheel, don't care the color, as long as in good condition.<P>3) The part is small, but difficult to explain. I would like the entire remote trunk release, rear defrost switching unit (it is the part that bolts to the right hand side of the instrument cluster). I don't need the rear defrost, but as long as you find the rear trunk release switch it will work.<P>I'll pay ya for your time and effort.<P>Can buy them all, and part them out for the rest of us.     <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><P>Thanks, Gold<BR><p>[This message has been edited by Gold-86SE (edited 05-24-2000).]||||reg||1
