Z||000004||ggarsk||05-24-2000||06:56 PM||||I was lucky this weekend to find a boneyard with a bunch of Fiero's in it. I got a cherry front aero fascia for $50. The cars haven't been picked thru real bad yet. Here's some of the things that are there: rear aero fascia,white ,excellent shape..$50 grey seat cover pass. side,4 headlight motors,don't know if they work..$9.50 apiece. 2 sets of deck lid grills. Tilt steering columns,center consules. And I believe a getrag in a '88. If anybody is interested in this or other parts let me know and I'll find out the prices if not already known. But the tranny is mine!!  I also find one of the all elusive ashtray lid springs.||||reg||1
Z||000005||LAMBO||05-24-2000||11:58 PM||||Hey guys, I'll try to see what I can come up with regards to your requests. I remember most of the things you're asking for were there in some shape or form. I think all the sun roof latches were gone. Must be an item that breaks alot. <P>My only problem at this point is time. I don't have alot of it right now, but will in a week or so. Might take the digital camera along and shoot some photos of the good stuff. There was one '86 there, red with black ground effects. Had alot of GT stuff on it, interior stuff, no wing though, but it was a notch back, didn't know they made such a thing in '86 (whoops, I'm showing some of my ignorance on Fieros here). Anyway, it was a sweet ride until someone killed themselves in it, pretty torn up from the seats forward.<P>Well, rambled long enough, talk to you all tomorrow.<P>Todd ||||reg||1
