Z||000009||LAMBO||05-25-2000||04:55 PM||||Got a pair of excellent SE style seats from the boneyard at lunch today. Light gray, will really make a difference in the way my interior looks right now. The great thing about these seats is that someone had already pulled them out of the car and set them up on the hood of the car directly behind the fiero. I could'nt believe my eyes, almost like someone knew I was coming after them. The guy at the counter said they'd been sitting there for a couple of weeks now. Good thing it hasn't rained in our part of Iowa since New Years.<BR>I sent everyone emails concerning their requests. Hope I don't disappoint to much.<P>||||reg||1
